  "debrief": "PixelForge looks scrappy but honest. Ownership was renounced with no back door, the big 'ecosystem' slice is locked behind a four-year schedule, the pool is the top holder because that's where liquidity lives, and the roadmap is refreshingly dull. A moderator asking people to chill is not a cover-up. Nineteen days old is young, not guilty; everything was new once.",
